CZChamp10A [-\]\: there are like 2-3 handi tournaments in Czechia every year ... like 15 normal ones .. so not trouble
CZChamp10A [-\]\: And of course ranking commission can object
CZChamp10A [-\]\: besides if you really have that low a rank, perhaps you really are 4d
Randomgu1 [8k\]\: I see, Thanks.
CZChamp10A [-\]\: And I haven't actually seen anyone voluntarily de-ranking himself, everybody likes to have high rank (hard to get in CZ)
]
